1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,292
The first text to a new lead does not have to come from a person.

2
00:00:05,292 --> 00:00:09,222
This video shows how an AI profile qualifies leads by text:

3
00:00:09,222 --> 00:00:14,179
the profile, the automatic activity load, what the load creates, and how the

4
00:00:14,179 --> 00:00:16,960
AI answers customers who text you first.

5
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:27,116
An automatic activity load creates activities that an AI profile works by itself.

6
00:00:27,116 --> 00:00:32,799
It sends the opening text, holds the whole conversation, and completes the activity

7
00:00:32,799 --> 00:00:35,290
with a disposition and a summary.

8
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,835
You decide how it behaves:

9
00:00:37,835 --> 00:00:42,379
how long it waits before replying, which cadence follows up when a customer

10
00:00:42,379 --> 00:00:45,520
goes quiet, and when those follow-ups may be sent.

11
00:00:46,270 --> 00:00:48,060
And you stay in control.

12
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:51,759
The AI stops when a customer opts out, and it can hand a

13
00:00:51,759 --> 00:00:55,220
customer to a live agent when the subject allows it.

14
00:00:59,413 --> 00:01:01,116
First, the AI profile.

15
00:01:01,116 --> 00:01:05,069
Under Artificial Intelligence, Profiles, click Add Profile.

16
00:01:05,069 --> 00:01:10,299
The Text messaging starting points include Qualify leads by text, which fills in

17
00:01:10,299 --> 00:01:13,643
the opening message and the instructions for you.

18
00:01:14,095 --> 00:01:15,010
Choose it.

19
00:01:15,010 --> 00:01:19,931
The title and the technical name are filled in for you, and you can change them.

20
00:01:19,931 --> 00:01:23,135
Pick a chat deployment, then click Create profile.

21
00:01:23,135 --> 00:01:25,595
The profile opens in the full editor.

22
00:01:27,989 --> 00:01:32,553
Start the conversation automatically is on, and the opening message is the first

23
00:01:32,553 --> 00:01:34,304
text the customer receives.

24
00:01:34,304 --> 00:01:38,019
Put your business name in it, and fill in the About the business

25
00:01:38,019 --> 00:01:41,309
section of the instructions, before you use the profile.

26
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:46,755
Now the load.

27
00:01:46,755 --> 00:01:51,640
Open Load Activities, click Add Activity Load, and choose Automatic.

28
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:57,120
Give it a title, then pick the subject type, the campaign and the AI profile.

29
00:01:57,570 --> 00:02:01,988
Allow the AI to update the contact or the subject lets it save

30
00:02:01,988 --> 00:02:05,106
what it learns, such as a corrected email.

31
00:02:05,106 --> 00:02:10,757
The reply delay can be none, fixed or random, so replies do not arrive instantly.

32
00:02:10,757 --> 00:02:13,290
Here the AI waits twenty seconds.

33
00:02:13,742 --> 00:02:18,404
Re-engagement is the cadence that follows up when the customer goes quiet.

34
00:02:18,404 --> 00:02:23,124
Business hours limit those follow-ups to the hours the calendar is open, in

35
00:02:23,124 --> 00:02:24,930
the customer's time zone.

36
00:02:24,930 --> 00:02:29,242
Then choose SMS as the channel, and the address the texts come from.

37
00:02:29,693 --> 00:02:32,246
Choose the contact type and save.

38
00:02:32,246 --> 00:02:35,453
The load is saved, but nothing is sent yet.

39
00:02:39,658 --> 00:02:42,945
From the load's menu, choose Load activities.

40
00:02:42,945 --> 00:02:47,972
The load starts in the background, and its row shows how many activities

41
00:02:47,972 --> 00:02:49,518
are loaded so far.

42
00:02:49,518 --> 00:02:55,319
When it finishes, the row shows how many contacts matched, and why any were skipped.

43
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:59,508
An automated activity is created for each matching contact.

44
00:02:59,959 --> 00:03:04,388
In the activity list, each of these is worked by the AI profile.

45
00:03:04,388 --> 00:03:10,589
A background task picks up the due activities every five minutes and sends the opening text.

46
00:03:10,589 --> 00:03:13,879
Every send checks the contact's opt-out first.

47
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:22,959
When a customer texts an opt-out keyword, such as STOP, the activity is

48
00:03:22,959 --> 00:03:26,317
cancelled and the contact is marked Do not SMS.

49
00:03:26,317 --> 00:03:28,979
The keywords are set on the subject.

50
00:03:29,729 --> 00:03:34,448
When the subject has a no-response timeout and the customer does not answer

51
00:03:34,448 --> 00:03:37,069
in time, the activity is marked failed.

52
00:03:37,819 --> 00:03:40,744
The reply delay chosen on the load wins.

53
00:03:40,744 --> 00:03:45,259
The subject's response delay applies only when the load has none.

54
00:03:49,464 --> 00:03:53,249
The AI can also answer customers who text you first.

55
00:03:53,249 --> 00:03:59,904
Under Inbound entry points, add a Text messages entry point, and pick the number customers text.

56
00:04:00,355 --> 00:04:06,191
On the Routing card, Route to offers a queue, a specific agent, or an AI agent.

57
00:04:06,191 --> 00:04:10,929
Choose AI agent and pick the profile, and the first text from a

58
00:04:10,929 --> 00:04:14,225
customer starts an automated conversation.

59
00:04:18,425 --> 00:04:23,378
When the conversation ends, the AI picks a disposition from your hints and

60
00:04:23,378 --> 00:04:27,960
what the customer said, and saves a summary as the activity's notes.

61
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:32,295
The subject flow then runs just as if an agent had completed it.

62
00:04:33,045 --> 00:04:40,600
To read the conversation, open the contact, click List Activities, and look under Completed Activities.

63
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:44,413
Review AI conversation opens the full transcript.

64
00:04:44,413 --> 00:04:47,255
It is read-only, with no reply box.

65
00:04:48,005 --> 00:04:52,409
If the subject allows live agent handoff, the AI can pass the customer

66
00:04:52,409 --> 00:04:55,539
to the handoff queue when they ask for a person.

67
00:04:55,539 --> 00:04:58,495
The handoff is the subject of the next video.

68
00:05:02,695 --> 00:05:06,105
Qualify new leads by text as soon as they arrive.

69
00:05:06,855 --> 00:05:11,225
Confirm appointments, or care for customers who ask a question.

70
00:05:11,975 --> 00:05:16,515
Follow up on quiet customers, only while the showroom is open.

71
00:05:17,265 --> 00:05:22,525
Answer a sales line by text, and hand over only the customers who are ready.

72
00:05:24,525 --> 00:05:27,687
Set up the profile once, load it on a list, and let the

73
00:05:27,687 --> 00:05:32,197
AI do the first conversation, so your people talk to the customers who are ready.

74
00:05:32,197 --> 00:05:33,545
Thanks for watching.

